            <ArticleTitle>Surgical considerations in off-pump coronary artery bypass grafting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>14-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1053/j.semtcvs.2011.05.004</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Off pump coronary artery bypass grafting remains an important technique particularly in the care of high-risk patients. Consistently successful adoption of this technique requires a cooperative team approach and standardization across all phases of patient care. This review describes our approach to off pump coronary surgery.</AbstractText>
